{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1156909-1001-vulgar-flourishes","id":1156909,"title":"1001 Vulgar flourishes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-07T23:23:50-08:00","id":1156909,"title":"1001 Vulgar flourishes","content":"Vulgar Effects are a good opportunity to bring across personal magical style and flair--and an otherworldliness befitting the blatant violation of the Consensus. The intensity of these secondary effects is mediated by the power of the actual Effect, the Resonance of the Mage, and the use of Quintessence.<br /> <br /> 1. Thunderclap<br /> 2. Vertigo<br /> 3. Fading afterimage (teleportation, enhanced speed)<br /> 4. Spasming tendrils of shadow<br /> 5. Dread<br /> 6. Conjured or teleported object first appears as a 2D image before resolving into 3 dimensions<br /> 7. Faint laughter<br /> 8. Fine spray of blood<br /> 9. Life conjuration sprouts out of the ground<br /> 10. Burst of multicolored light<br /> 11. Corona of cold green flame<br /> 12. Chorus of angels<br /> 13. Dstortion of of vision near the Effect<br /> 14. Arcane symbols appearing on surfaces or in the air<br /> 15. Brief change in temperature<br /> 16. A subtle parallax effect that (to a person with binocular vision) makes the object of the Effect look much farther than it should be.<br /> 17. Skin crawling sensation<br /> 18. Discoloration, possibly long term if subtle<br /> 19. Nearby animals cry out in unison<br /> 20. Euphoria<br /> 21. Superficial cracks forming in nearby objects<br /> 23. Slight but permanent warping of nearby objects' shape<br /> 24. The smell of burning flesh<br /> 25. Prickling, stinging sensaiton<br /> 26. Caster appears to have glowing eyes<br /> 27. Ferrous taste in the mouth<br /> 28. Hypnotic coils of light<br /> 29. Onlookers briefly see every side of objects simultaneously<br /> 30. Opaque 2 dimensional shapes<br /> 31. Sense that things are happening in slow motion, as with a violent tragedy<br /> 32. Smoke<br /> 33. Caster appears to somehow be displaying many intense facial expressions at once<br /> 34. Rush of adrenaline<br /> 35. Static electricity<br /> 36. Shuddering vibrations<br /> 37. Slight pull or push on objects and onlookers<br /> 38. Momentary paralysis<br /> 39. Otherworldly music<br /> 40. Intrusive thoughts in an inhuman language<br /> 41. Scorch marks<br /> 42. Sense of unity with the universe<br /> 43. Sense of worthlessness within a vast uncaring universe<br /> 44. Sense of being observed by a powerful presence<br /> 45. Sense of being as fragile as glass<br /> 46. Air tastes sweet and nourishing<br /> 47. Primal terror<br /> 48. Dissociation<br /> 49. Halos<br /> 50. Sense that everything is uncomfortably alive","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","user":"Faradn","date":".  Edited intro to correct typo. 11-14-2017, 01:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T02:58:51-08:00","id":1158118,"title":"","content":"Thinking on it, this would make for a good guide to high Resonance mages, and how that affects their magick.<br /> <br /> <br /> 51. Wailing and gnashing of teeth<br /> <br /> 52. Bass drops<br /> <br /> 53. Shadows filled with glowing red eyes<br /> <br /> 54. Colored aura surrounding object<br /> <br /> 55. Fantastical figure (probably the Avatar) acts out the effect, like some kind of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure\" target=\"_blank\">Stand</a><br /> <br /> 56. Momentary silence<br /> <br /> 57. Hair stands on end<br /> <br /> 58. Gravity feels stronger<br /> <br /> 59. Ambient light dims noticeably<br /> <br /> 60. Eyeglasses gain eye-obscuring glare<br /> <br /> 61. Ephemeral guitar riff<br /> <br /> 62. Electronic hum<br /> <br /> 63. Ghostly backup musicians appear to accompany<br /> <br /> 64. Sound effect captions appear<br /> <br /> 65. Appearing object/figure exits from a portal<br /> <br /> 66. Huge occult symbol appears briefly behind the caster<br /> <br /> 67. Ears pop<br /> <br /> 68. Sonic boom<br /> <br /> 69. Sparkles<br /> <br /> 70. Disembodied eyes open all around<br /> <br /> 71. Illusory showers of gold or cash<br /> <br /> 72. Mage seems to grow in proportion to their effect on the scene at the moment, until they tower over everyone else<br /> <br /> 73. Sculptures and paintings come to life around the area and react appropriately<br /> <br /> 74. Mirrors reflect ominous figures<br /> <br /> 75. Clock ticking sound, changing pace as appropriate","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T06:28:38-08:00","id":1158155,"title":"","content":"Don't have the time to add to this but just want to say these are great. It's always easy to come up with big paradox effects but the lesser one always elude me. This list will be a part of my hardcopy notes from now on.","signature":"","edited":{"useri